Fixes: 50c812b2b951 ("[PATCH] ipmi: add full sysfs support")
Signed-off-by: Wen Yang <wenyang@linux.alibaba.com>
Cc: Corey Minyard <minyard@acm.org>
Cc: Arnd Bergmann <arnd@arndb.de>
